calamares-settings-ubuntu (1:26.04.12+unity1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * basicwallpaper: on X11, map the wallpaper as a desktop window that never
    takes focus, instead of a fullscreen one. xfwm4 raises a focused
    fullscreen window above all others, so the wallpaper covered Calamares
    in the Ubuntu Unity OEM first-time setup session whenever it got focus:
    when it mapped after Calamares, or on Alt+Tab. Wayland (Kubuntu) is
    unchanged.

